BT /F1 10 Tf 56 285.7 Td (Employees should coordinate with their line manager to schedule this day off at a mutually) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 271.2 Td (convenient time. Failure to take the compensatory day off within the 30-day window may) Tj ET
