BT /F1 10 Tf 56 742.5 Td (advance notice periods. Leave longer than 3 days must be applied for at least 14 days in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 728.0 Td (advance. This requirement allows line managers sufficient time to arrange coverage and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 713.5 Td (manage workflow disruptions. Shorter leaves may be approved with less notice, subject to) Tj ET
