BT /F1 10 Tf 56 569.9 Td (New joiners accrue leave from day one of their employment. This means that the entitlement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 555.4 Td (begins building up immediately, regardless of probationary status. However, there are) Tj ET
