BT /F1 10 Tf 56 482.9 Td (applies to all permanent shore staff during their probationary period. Sick leave and other) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 468.4 Td (statutory leaves remain available as per standard policy from day one. Line managers should) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 453.9 Td (be aware of this restriction when approving or denying leave requests for new joiners within) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 439.4 Td (their first three months.) Tj ET
