BT /F1 10 Tf 56 339.4 Td (compensated for time off they were unable to utilize due to the timing of their departure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 310.4 Td (Encashment is calculated based on the basic salary. The payout covers unused annual leave up) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 295.9 Td (to a maximum of 30 days. Any balance exceeding this cap will not be paid out and will be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 281.4 Td (forfeited upon exit. Employees are encouraged to use their accrued leave before their last) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 266.9 Td (working day to maximize their benefit, subject to approval from their line manager and HRBP.) Tj ET
